known_false_positives.description:
There's a missing closing brace for the `if (testContent)` block on line 75. The code structure shows:
- Line 74: `if (testContent) {`
- Line 75-77: statements inside the if
- Line 78: standalone `}`
- Line 79: `}` (this closes the else-if from line 66)
- Line 80: `});` (this closes the forEach from line 55)

But there's no closing brace for the `if (testContent)` block. This will cause a syntax error. The fix:

